      "content_html": "<figure><img alt=\"Skiing Takes a Toll on Your Knees. Here’s the Muscle You Need to Strengthen, According to an Orthopedic Surgeon.\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ski-monster-walks-featured.jpg?width=1200\"/></figure>\n<p>Your ski strength routine might be missing exercises that target the gluteus medius. An orthopedic surgeon shares how and why strengthening this muscle can improve knee health.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/health/training-performance/gluteus-medius-skiing-exercises-knee-health/\">Skiing Takes a Toll on Your Knees. Here’s the Muscle You Need to Strengthen, According to an Orthopedic Surgeon.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
